  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Architect SAR Tor Eriksson will assist the Urban division in the fieldof planning and urban environment, e.g. in the Lake Victoria initiative, following-up of the urban programme in South Africa, pre-feasibility study for an urban programme in Zambia, preparation of UTS and urban environment policy.</narrative>
